	(text "MCP2221A at 3.3V: VDD and VUSB tied to +3V3 (from host board LDO)\nFor 5V operation: VDD = VBUS, VUSB to 470nF only\n~{RST} 10k pull-up; I2C 4.7k pull-ups on SDA/SCL; GP0-3 left NC\nUART only TXD/RXD (no flow control). Avoid old MCP2221 (NRND)"
